PuzzleXY - a sliding puzzle of any width and height, with numbers or a picture on the tiles
(Andre Fischer)

  PuzzleLayLaP.GUI        the board maker

In the board maker: the name of the picture (Egypt.Pict, or l038102.jpg; Enter loads it), the
number of tiles across and down, the size of a tile in pixels, and whether the picture is scaled
to the board. Create board opens a board; Board description shows its LayLa description.

On a board: Scramble mixes the tiles. A middle click on a tile in the row or the column of the
free place slides it there, with the tiles between. Flip Tiles shows the numbers or the picture.
